New in 2026-09-16

  Updated WallpaperSelector.qml - Wallpaper selector has larger thumbnails in the gallery, and scrolling is handled by the mousewheel.  When hovered over, the gallery thumbnail will zoom to 1.5 : 1.
  This eliminates the need for a popup preview window.   shell.qml also updated for the WallpeperSelector references.

